@guide H_52_Winterspring
@name Winterspring (54-55)
@faction Horde
@levels 54-55
@zone Winterspring
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Winterspring, visit 1 of 2 on the Horde route, levels 54-55.
@next H_53_Felwood

travel Winterspring
train
note From Nafien in north Felwood, walk through Timbermaw Hold (the tunnel behind him). The Timbermaw furbolgs inside leave you alone unless you have killed their kin. Salfa waits at the Winterspring exit.
turnin 8465 Speak to Salfa | Salfa, at the Winterspring end of the tunnel.
note Ride east along the road to Everlook.
fp Everlook
accept 3783 Are We There, Yeti? | Umi Rumplesnicker, Everlook.
accept 5054 Ursius of the Shardtooth | Storm Shadowhoof, Everlook.
accept 6029 The Everlook Report | Gregor Greystone. Turned in at the Bulwark (Western Plaguelands).
accept 6030 Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff | Gregor Greystone. Turned in at Light's Hope Chapel (Eastern Plaguelands).
accept 6603 Trouble in Winterspring! | Meggi Peppinrocker, Everlook. Turned in to Donova Snowden on the way out.
accept 6605 A Strange One
complete 5054 Ursius of the Shardtooth | Ursius, a big bear in the hills north of Everlook.
turnin 5054 Ursius of the Shardtooth | Storm Shadowhoof.
complete 3783 Are We There, Yeti? | Thick Yeti Fur from Rogue Ice Thistle yetis on the road west of Everlook.
turnin 3783 Are We There, Yeti? | Umi Rumplesnicker, Everlook.
turnin 6603 Trouble in Winterspring! | Donova Snowden at the hot springs south of the tunnel exit.
turnin 5083 Winterfall Firewater
accept 5084 Falling to Corruption
accept 5082 Threat of the Winterfall
complete 5082 Threat of the Winterfall | Winterfall Pathfinders, Den Watchers and Totemics in the two furbolg camps around Donova.
turnin 5082 Threat of the Winterfall
level 55 | Felwood starts at 55. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
